_struct_biol.details   
;THE BIOLOGICALLY RELEVANT UNITS ARE THE                      
 FOLLOWING HETERODIMERS:HISF/HISH CHAIN A/CHAIN B                     
 , HISF/HISH CHAIN C/CHAIN D, HISF/HISHCHAIN E/                       
 CHAIN F. THERE ARE SIGNIFICANT CONFORMATIONAL                        
 DIFFERENCESIN THE THREE HETERO-DIMERS, HENCE THEY                    
 CANNOT BE RELATED BYUNIQUE SETS OF NCS OPERATORS.
;
